###
### Direct Service Access (bypassing API Gateway)
###

### Direct TTS Health Check
GET {{ttsUrl}}/health

### Direct TTS Synthesize
POST {{ttsUrl}}/api/tts/synthesize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Direct TTS test",
  "language": "en",
  "user_id": "test-user"
}

###
### Test with Variables
###

@userId = test-user-123
@text = This is a test from VS Code REST Client

### Use Variables in Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tts/synthesize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "{{text}}",
  "language": "en",
  "user_id": "{{userId}}"
}
